{
  "info": {
    "name": "PAD-team1 / crafting-service",
    "description": "Every endpoint of crafting-service.\n\nSet `playerToken` and `serviceToken` first:\n\n    docker compose exec app bundle exec rake token:player\n    docker compose exec app bundle exec rake token:service\n\nRun the folders top to bottom with the Collection Runner. `jobId` is captured from the craft request. `event_id` uses {{$guid}} so re-running never replays an old idempotency record.",
